order-color\" data-source=\"marketable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Marketable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"value\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Value</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">80 gp</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcvalue\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sold for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">40 gp</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcprice\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">80 gp</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">7.6<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 12, 2005<br/>Christmas Update 2005</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20060226202224&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Orichalcum_Pearl_051707.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see an orichalcum pearl.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 0.30 oz.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Has special properties that enables them to be used for magical methods of travel, which can only be utilised by Premium players, however. Looks the same as the <a href=\"#/wiki/White%20Pearl\">White Pearl</a>. It's suggested to always have a few of these in your backpack.<br/>\nYou need to complete the <i>Astral Portals</i> mission in <a href=\"#/quest/the-explorer-society-quest\">The Explorer Society Quest</a> to be able to buy and use them.<br/>Lets you travel from <a href=\"#/wiki/Port%20Hope\">Port Hope</a> to <a href=\"#/wiki/Northport\">Northport</a> (near <a href=\"#/wiki/Carlin\">Carlin</a>) or back. The same applies for <a href=\"#/wiki/Liberty%20Bay\">Liberty Bay</a> to <a href=\"#/wiki/Svargrond\">Svargrond</a>. Also needed to use the teleports in the <a href=\"#/wiki/Knightwatch%20Tower\">Knightwatch Tower</a> after you complete the <a href=\"#/quest/dreamers-challenge-quest\">Dreamer's Challenge Quest</a>.<br/>Can be obtained from the <a href=\"#/quest/the-pits-of-inferno-quest\">Pits of Inferno Quest</a> and from <a href=\"#/wiki/Gooey%20Mass\">Gooey Masses</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Betrayed%20Wraith\">Betrayed Wraith</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Broken%20Shaper\">Broken Shaper</a